*
!.gitignore

# Real uploaded content (dentist/patient avatars, HMO provider logos) —
# tracked on purpose so a fresh deploy (e.g. Railway, pulling only from
# git) doesn't come up with broken images for data that already exists.
# Anything else generated into storage/app/public/ in the future stays
# ignored by the blanket rule above unless explicitly allowed here too.
!avatars/
!avatars/**
!hmo-logos/
!hmo-logos/**
